{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"fbadf9f33eb3d2da","name":"card_unit_14_panzergrenadier","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Germany/OceaniaStorm/units/card_unit_14_panzergrenadier","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"14. PANZERGRENADIER","text":"Becomes Veteran when you deploy a tank.","flavorText":"The 14. Panzergrenadier Regiment served as one of the two panzergrenadier regiments of the 5th Panzer Division on the Eastern Front. It had previously appeared in the division’s 1940 organization as Schützen-Regiment 14 before becoming a mechanized infantry formation supporting the division’s tanks. The division was formed in 1938 and fought in Poland, France and the Balkans before being sent East for Operation Barbarossa. It advanced to within 34 km of Moscow before being forced back by the Soviet counteroffensive. For the remainder of the war, the division fought mainly defensive battles on the Eastern Front and earned a formidable reputation. Soviet commanders regarded the 5th Panzer Division as one of Germany’s best formations and, until July 1944, the Soviet High Command reportedly advised avoiding direct engagement with it whenever possible. The division survived Operation Bagration and continued fighting through Poland, Courland and East Prussia before its remnants surrendered in Danzig in April 1945.","faction":"Germany","type":"infantry","rarity":"Rare","cost":3,"operationCost":1,"attack":3,"defense":5},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_unit_14_panzergrenadier","title":{"Namespace":"card_germany","Key":"card_unit_14_panzergrenadier_title","SourceString":"14. PANZERGRENADIER","LocalizedString":"14. PANZERGRENADIER"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::infantry","attack":3,"defense":5,"range":1,"faction":"EFactionEnum::Germany","kredits":3,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_germany","Key":"card_unit_14_panzergrenadier_text","SourceString":"Becomes Veteran when you deploy a tank.","LocalizedString":"Becomes Veteran when you deploy a tank."},"flavorTex